/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;CAN_TX_B&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;PC11 (CN7-2)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;DEG_A (LED)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;PC3 (CN7-37)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;DEG_B (LED)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;PC2 (CN7-35)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;9&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;PWM_SET&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;PC6 (CN10-4)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;PWM_OUT&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;PA0 (A0)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;11&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;DIR_A&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;PB3 (D3)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;12&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;RL&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;PB9 (D14)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;13&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;RR&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;PB8 (D15)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fffbea;strokeColor=#b58b00;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="600" width="465" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c81" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#b58b00;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1432" y="580" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1432" y="600" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c82" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1200" y="560" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1186" y="560" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c83" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1186" y="560" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1186" y="900" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c84" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=9;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="66" y="900" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1640" y="900" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c85" value="&lt;b&gt;Common GND&lt;/b&gt;: Pi, N2, N3 and the bus breadboard (wired before anything else)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="904" width="900" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c86" value="Notes. (1) Module pin D9 is MISO and D10 is MOSI on these boards (the handout figure has them swapped). (2) Termination uses the P1 pad on N1's and N3's modules; P1 sits on the module side of the jumper, so pulling an end node's jumper also removes that bus end's terminator (R4.3 wants it on the bus side; known trade-off, discrete 120 Ω on the rail ends would fix it). (3) CANH–CANL measured powered off: bus A 58 Ω. (4) Bus levels (photos 8–9): idle ≈ 2.2 V both lines, dominant differential 2.07 V (A) / 1.97 V (B)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="925" width="1640" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>